{"id":1039,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为帮助新生尽快融入研究生生活，明确学业方向，9月14日下午，我院在15205Z教室召开2026级新生入学教育主题班会。本次班会由学院团委书记刘莉莉主持，院长赵笑蕾、党委副书记、副院长李庆乐出席并讲话，2026级全体新生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-ozTW2L7U4M7VfoHRLYLR94MzVVMNLg8UNMfMzlioRA7ozv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyanSyZnkhVnmTkMRrfMzUPMzGsnRGPU4UPLmCPolU4nmfFLNQfolUYM4WFMlMVMNlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4viM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E0E8DEF9B45A541507D01C412619D3F0/2FA9D272/5CE6E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-LRLWiL8V2MNVkLHlLsLm9sL7V2MzWgVLR9sMRviMznRU4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkUShknky4o7WRLzl4nNCinmnkUzU4UlLPMmQRMR7bM4QFMm-Yoz7aUzrFL4GZn7CDgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysMzvigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\"></p><p>院长赵笑蕾对2026级新生寄予殷切期许，望同学们珍惜研究生时光，治学之上锚定方向，沉心钻研理论，于深耕求索中锤炼科研能力，圆满完成学业；要恪守修身立德，丰盈精神底蕴，淬炼综合素养，实现为学与修身相得益彰；将个人理想汇入时代洪流，笃行奋进，成长为兼具扎实学识与高尚品格的新时代青年。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-Mm9WbU474L4vYMH498L7lsozU8nmGgsnzW7U4fVnNn2Uz70gihFp2hmCIa0LSyan1yiM1h2LR9iozviUlWfM8C4M4Wfn7U4Uz74Um9iUmrFMzf7nm7inznFMzGPL4UJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4viM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/10F56F085975ABA7F372ADD3A13B85B5/50DF15E4/50134\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-L4TWkLzlPL47PnHzNbL462LNLiLzUg8M4vPnRWRM4Q7nlL0gihFp2hmCIa0okhknkysoSyPL7nfnR7bo7lsMNQVolLDoR94UzUioRTVMmWFnll8U8LZnRfFLN-snz-DgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysMzvigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\"></p><p>党委副书记李庆乐强调研究生阶段时间宝贵，同学们要尽早明确目标，做好阶段规划。要充分用好学院平台资源，积极参与学术活动和社会实践，在学好专业的同时拓宽视野、提升综合素质，为未来发展打下坚实基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MzTWVoznfM4vaoHzW2M4G8LlrRMRCg8LNlsMl-bM4vPL4-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4M1yanSyaM77bMmCDMmV7MRVRLlWknRT2oRW2nN-YL8VFMRvYnlW2M46FMz-DUmvJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4viM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0360E04A966661D41C1BBD9F82FFB23A/472EBF77/526B7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-Uz7WboRlaM7UYUHmGYL4rRM8nfnRUgDMN-iLmLDM4GZUzU0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVLkhfLYyioRlZUz7inmNiLlV2Mm-Po774MzGsMR9iU46Fn7-PnRvYLNrFM77anmlZgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysMzvigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\"></p><p>刘莉莉老师就校规校纪、安全和防诈骗、创新教育等进行了专题教育，引导大家尽快适应研究生生活。同时勉励大家树立求学目标，做好生涯规划，在学习和实践中坚定信仰致知于行。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MRnWVUmCaU4UPnHmGiLlr7UmlYnR7gZUmvPLNC4UzNYM8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyaLYh7LYyYUzVknzQ7M4NiLNW7UNLaollPnNWVLmGbLNMFUmf7LlMkM7rFMRn7Um9Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4viM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/503D32A1BE6D7952BDBC09E1FBE2092C/B0D1CB4E/44DB8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-UlQW2L7MkLln2nHN-snmGanl-Ynm9gbUz7Ynzf2Uz7DMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVUYyZMYyDMNM2oRlZnl7PM49aLmfRMlWVUmrRMmNDU8QFMNn7Mm-bL7rFLmLioz-4gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysMzvigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\"></p><p>班会最后，新生们依次作了简短自我介绍，现场气氛轻松融洽。此次班会是新生进入研究生阶段的第一课，既有师长的殷切嘱托，也有同窗的初识相知。愿2026级新同学以此为新的起点，勤学善思、砥砺深耕，不负韶华奔赴崭新征程！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nm6WkM8VVollsMH7lZL47iM49iLRQg7MzGPnRCiozCsolL0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPn1h7LSy4Ll7aMm6kM8rfM49DLmLaM4GsMRrkMNnfnmrFolrRM878MRVFL4NDUmvJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4viM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E1FD131A067B7EA78623070745B6DAF5/9EC7A441/396B7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nmMW7L8V7LNU8MHzlPozlPL87iUzGgPo7LbU4UZnNLYM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDL1hVMYhfoR7iM8CZMlnfnNlbUNliLR6RolL8o7rkMRMFozvsoRQ2LRVFLNCsL4lsgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysMzvigtA8pULcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-ozTW2L7U4M7VfoHRLYLR94MzVVMNLg8UNMfMzlioRA7ozv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyanSyZnkhVnmTkMRrfMzUPMzGsnRGPU4UPLmCPolU4nmfFLNQfolUYM4WFMlMVMNlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4viM4lJqdLnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7575&e=.jpg"}